    <briefdescription>
<para>Per-channel register base addresses. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each channel has its own set of registers at a specific base address. Per datasheet Table 25 (Register Address Space - Channel):<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>CH0: 0x0040</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>CH1: 0x0050</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>CH2: 0x0060</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>CH3: 0x0070</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>CH4: 0x0020</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>CH5: 0x0030</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Note: Channels are NOT in sequential order. CH4 and CH5 have lower addresses. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
